The permissions granted by this License **do not include permission to commercially distribute the Software or a derivative work based substantially on the Software**.

In particular, without prior written permission from the Copyright Holder, you may not:

1. sell or license Blockline itself;
2. sell or license a fork or modified version that is substantially based on Blockline;
3. distribute Blockline or a substantially modified version as a commercial competing product;
4. offer Blockline or a substantially modified version as a paid hosted or managed service;
5. package Blockline into a commercial product where Blockline itself constitutes a substantial part of the product; or
6. establish or operate a commercial organization, foundation, or project whose principal product is a substantially modified or rebranded version of Blockline.

This restriction does **not** prohibit independent commercial software that merely interoperates with Blockline, provided that such software does not incorporate substantial portions of the Blockline source code.

Commercial addons, plugins, integrations, themes, services, and other independent works may be created and sold provided that they do not incorporate substantial portions of the Blockline source code and do not falsely represent themselves as Official Blockline products.

The Copyright Holder may grant separate commercial licenses or permissions at its discretion.

